      ],
      "source": "https://www.goadirondack.com/entries/keeseville-ny",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "From 1890 to 1924, the Keeseville, Ausable Chasm & Lake Champlain Railroad linked Port Kent steamships with the Delaware & Hudson line.",
